   "id": "overview",
   "title": "Overview",
   "type": "text",
   "paragraphs": [
    "Shared reference domains and values, and the fee schedule / settings of every module.",
    "Owned by <a href=\"/domains/core\">Enterprise Core</a>. Other services read it through read-only JPA entities in turfclub-common.",
    "Every table carries <code>created_at / created_by / updated_at / updated_by / version_no</code>; audit triggers copy each change into <code>audit_compliance.audit_event</code>, and version triggers increment <code>version_no</code> for optimistic locking."
   ]
  },
